    <li>burning</li>
    <li>ember</li>
    <li>燃烧弹</li>
  </UWU_IncendiarySwap.labelKeywords>

  <!-- EN: EMP value split -->
  <UWU_EmpSplit.label>EMP价值拆分</UWU_EmpSplit.label>
  <!-- EN: Removes spacer components, then converts 70% of base material costs into industrial components by market value, representing the electronic parts needed for EMP modifications. -->
  <UWU_EmpSplit.description>先移除高级零部件，再按市场价值将70%的基础材料成本转换为零部件，代表EMP改造所需的电子元件。</UWU_EmpSplit.description>
  <!-- EN: emp, flux, voltaic, sonic, shock, arc, thunder -->
  <UWU_EmpSplit.labelKeywords>
    <li>emp</li>
    <li>flux</li>
    <li>voltaic</li>
    <li>sonic</li>
    <li>shock</li>
    <li>arc</li>
    <li>thunder</li>
  </UWU_EmpSplit.labelKeywords>

  <!-- EN: lightweight swap -->
  <UWU_Lightweight.label>轻便替换</UWU_Lightweight.label>
  <!-- EN: Replaces 40% of wood costs with birdskin, representing the featherwork used to lighten wooden weapons. Weapons with no wood in their costs are unaffected. -->
  <UWU_Lightweight.description>将40%的原木成本替换为鸟皮，代表为木制武器减重所用的羽毛工艺。成本中不含原木的武器不受影响。</UWU_Lightweight.description>
  <!-- EN: lightweight, whisper -->
  <UWU_Lightweight.labelKeywords>
    <li>lightweight</li>
    <li>whisper</li>
    <li>轻便</li>
  </UWU_Lightweight.labelKeywords>

  <!-- EN: flarestriker value split -->
  <UWU_Flarestriker.label>照明弹价值拆分</UWU_Flarestriker.label>
  <!-- EN: Converts 70% of base material costs into bioferrite by market value, reflecting the exotic fuel source needed for flare launchers. -->
  <UWU_Flarestriker.description>按市场价值将70%的基础材料成本转换为活铁，以体现照明弹发射器所需的特殊燃料来源。</UWU_Flarestriker.description>
  <!-- EN: flare, flarestriker -->
  <UWU_Flarestriker.labelKeywords>
    <li>flare</li>
    <li>flarestriker</li>
    <li>照明弹</li>
  </UWU_Flarestriker.labelKeywords>

  <!-- EN: heavy scrap flat cost -->
  <UWU_HeavyScrap.label>重型废料固定成本</UWU_HeavyScrap.label>
  <!-- EN: Replaces all costs with a single steel slag chunk. Scrap modifications are crude and cheap — just bolt on some junk. -->
  <UWU_HeavyScrap.description>将全部成本替换为一块钢渣块。废料改造既粗糙又廉价——只是拿螺栓拧上些破铜烂铁而已。</UWU_HeavyScrap.description>

  <!-- EN: charge weapons (category-gated) -->
  <UWU_ChargeCategoryGated.label>电荷武器（限定类别）</UWU_ChargeCategoryGated.label>
  <!-- EN: Converts all costs into advanced components by market value for charge-type weapon traits, representing the spacer technology required for pulse and beam modifications. -->
  <UWU_ChargeCategoryGated.description>对于电荷类武器特性，按市场价值将全部成本转换为高级零部件，代表电荷与光束改造所需的太空时代技术。</UWU_ChargeCategoryGated.description>

  <!-- EN: charge weapons (unconditional) -->
  <UWU_ChargeUnconditional.label>电荷武器（无条件）</UWU_ChargeUnconditional.label>
  <!-- EN: Converts all costs into advanced components by market value for traits involving advanced spacer technology, regardless of weapon category. -->
  <UWU_ChargeUnconditional.description>对于涉及高等太空时代技术的特性，无论武器属于哪个类别，都按市场价值将全部成本转换为高级零部件。</UWU_ChargeUnconditional.description>
