  <!-- EN: akimbo cost multiplier -->
  <UWU_Akimbo.label>双持成本倍率</UWU_Akimbo.label>
  <!-- EN: Doubles all costs to reflect that akimbo adds a second rendered weapon and doubles the fire rate. This counteracts the base 50% cost fraction to bring the total to full recipe cost. -->
  <UWU_Akimbo.description>将全部成本翻倍，以体现双持会额外绘制第二把武器并使射速翻倍。这会抵消50%的基础成本比例，使总额达到完整的配方成本。</UWU_Akimbo.description>

  <!-- EN: oversized cost multiplier -->
  <UWU_Oversized.label>超大型成本倍率</UWU_Oversized.label>
  <!-- EN: Increases all costs by half. An oversized weapon is simply more weapon, and modifying it takes more material. -->
  <UWU_Oversized.description>将全部成本提高一半。超大型武器无非是分量更足的武器，改造它自然需要更多材料。</UWU_Oversized.description>

  <!-- EN: grip component removal -->
  <UWU_Grip.label>握把零部件移除</UWU_Grip.label>
  <!-- EN: Removes industrial and spacer components from the cost. Grip modifications are simple mechanical adjustments that don't require complex parts. -->
  <UWU_Grip.description>从成本中移除零部件与高级零部件。握把改造只是简单的机械调整，不需要复杂的元件。</UWU_Grip.description>

  <!-- EN: comfort material conversion -->
  <UWU_Comfort.label>舒适材料转换</UWU_Comfort.label>
  <!-- EN: Converts half of all cost materials to thrumbofur by count, reflecting the luxurious padding and wrapping used for comfort modifications. -->
  <UWU_Comfort.description>按数量将全部成本材料的一半转换为敲击兽皮，以体现舒适改造所用的高档衬垫与缠绕材料。</UWU_Comfort.description>

  <!-- EN: ornamental conversion -->
  <UWU_Ornamental.label>华丽转换</UWU_Ornamental.label>
  <!-- EN: Removes components, then converts half of remaining costs to silver by count. Ornamental work is decorative craftsmanship, not technical engineering. -->
  <UWU_Ornamental.description>先移除零部件，再按数量将剩余成本的一半转换为白银。华丽的工艺属于装饰性的手艺，而非技术性的工程。</UWU_Ornamental.description>
